From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Takashi Toyoshima <toyoshim@chromium.org>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 21:26:13 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 02/48] Fix kDiskCacheDir check in ChromeContentBrowserClient

`InitOnUIThread()` checked `user_data_dir.IsParent(cache_dir)` instead
of `pref_cache_dir` when populating
`network_contexts_parent_directory_`. Introduce
`chrome_browser_net::GetDiskCacheDir()` to ignore user-controlled or
invalid `prefs::kDiskCacheDir` values consistently across
`InitOnUIThread()`, `GetGeneratedCodeCacheSettings()`, and
`ProfileNetworkContextService`.

TAG=agy
CONV=ad5e5ad9-7bec-4ac8-b110-b95f20678701

Bug: 556221528
Change-Id: I2a93c9ee423217774b051d9b4450102dfb044054
